  "extractionNotes": "Grant evidenced by the closing note (sickness benefit in pregnancy and maternity benefit paid) and by a ZUS letter asking for the single-title statement needed to pay the top-up to the 1000 zl parental-benefit level for 2025-02-06..2026-02-04, which equals the whole claimed maternity + parental period; the claimant then filed the statement. The maternity/parental split is the claim (ZAM). The ZAM 81.5% declaration box is unticked although both periods were claimed together within 21 days of the birth, so averaged81_5 is inferred and no rate is asserted. Birth date: birth extract illegible; taken as the first maternity day. Title: the ZUS register screenshot is partly illegible; a Maly ZUS Plus (0590) self-employed title from 2022-04-18 with voluntary sickness insurance, and a 0510 row around the birth, are visible; one self-employed title is modelled. Declared bases are not in the file (months empty); the top-up shows the benefit was under 1000 zl net per month. Pregnancy sickness benefit (one e-ZLA of 17 days, year illegible) was paid but is not modelled. The other parent's statement is illegible."
